    test/store-check.sh (--uninstall; mutant SG_MUTANT_NOUNINSTALL).
  * SG Store: a package's dependencies are installed first. The winget
    manifest reader (src/browser/manifest.c) reads Dependencies ->
    PackageDependencies, at the root or per installer (not Windows features
    or MinimumVersion); before a package installs, each package it needs
    does, through the same path, two levels deep at most. A dependency is
    skipped when the system provides it (Microsoft.VCRedist.*: Wine's own
    runtime), when the catalogue's app of that id is detected, or when SG
