    - Opera did not install ("The installer stopped with code 103"): its
      winget manifest gives each installer Custom switches (/allusers=0 or
      1), which winget always passes and the store dropped, so Opera's
      installer could not choose a folder ("The path is invalid"). The
      store now passes a manifest's Custom switches after the silent ones
      (SumatraPDF's -install as well). Test: test/store-check.sh (mutant
      NOCUSTOM); test/browser-manifest-test.c (Opera's manifest).
